@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
start
:Take one immutable snapshot\n(inputs + old committed state);
:Evaluate all transitions simultaneously\n→ candidate state;
:Evaluate requested intents\n(unprimed x = old state, x' = candidate);
:Apply Boolean constraints\n→ safe intents;
note right
  A constraint that forces an
  output safe is NOT a failed scan.
end note
if (Evaluation and validation succeeded?) then (yes)
  :Commit candidate state and\nrequested/safe scan record atomically;
else (no)
  :Roll back: keep prior committed state;\nexpose no partial candidate;
endif
stop
@enduml
